{"title": "High Spellcasting (+1)", "pageid": 28195, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/High_Spellcasting_(+1)", "categories": ["Passive item features", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote noexcerpt\">Not to be confused with <a href=\"/wiki/High_Spellcasting_(%2B2)\" title=\"High Spellcasting (+2)\">High Spellcasting (+2)</a>        </div>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>High Spellcasting</b> is a passive feature that makes the wearers spells more potent and difficult to defend against.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>You gain a +1 bonus to <a href=\"/wiki/Spell_Save_DC\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Spell Save DC\">Spell Save DC</a>. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the weapons:</p><ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-very-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Infernal_Rapier\" title=\"Infernal Rapier\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5a/Infernal_Rapier_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Infernal_Rapier_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5a/Infernal_Rapier_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Infernal_Rapier_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5a/Infernal_Rapier_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Infernal_Rapier_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5a/Infernal_Rapier_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Infernal_Rapier_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5a/Infernal_Rapier_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Infernal_Rapier\" title=\"Infernal Rapier\">Infernal Rapier</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>Granted by the equipment:</p><ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-very-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Armour_of_Landfall\" title=\"Armour of Landfall\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b3/Armour_of_Landfall_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Armour_of_Landfall_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b3/Armour_of_Landfall_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Armour_of_Landfall_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b3/Armour_of_Landfall_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Armour_of_Landfall_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b3/Armour_of_Landfall_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Armour_of_Landfall_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b3/Armour_of_Landfall_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Armour_of_Landfall\" title=\"Armour of Landfall\">Armour of Landfall</a></span></li><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fistbreaker_Helm\" title=\"Fistbreaker Helm\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5e/Fistbreaker_Helm_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Fistbreaker_Helm_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5e/Fistbreaker_Helm_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Fistbreaker_Helm_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5e/Fistbreaker_Helm_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Fistbreaker_Helm_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5e/Fistbreaker_Helm_Unf